  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 COD - Settlement Extents v4.0",
    "description": "The GRID3 COD - Settlement Extents v4.0 dataset is a spatial data layer in OGC Geopackage format. This version supersedes GRID3 COD - Settlement Extents v3.1 . The following changes were made: Creation of blocks in urban and semi-urban areas; Removal of hamlets and edge-blocks with zero-building count unless settlement has been confirmed through fieldwork Change of data schema Dataset citation Center for Integrated Earth System Information (CIESIN), Columbia University. 2026. GRID3 COD - Settlement Extents v4.0. New York: Columbia University. https://doi.org/10.7916/bb5b-9b79. Accessed [DAY MONTH YEAR]. Contacts and data queries The authors of this dataset appreciate feedback regarding the data, including suggestions, discovery of errors, difficulties in using the data, and format preferences. For dataset-related questions, please send an email to: info@ciesin.columbia.edu",
    "datetime": "2026-07-01T00:00:00Z",
    "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
